      "role": "user",
      "content": "uh, i'm not sure what u mean by the goblin thing lol. anyway, the audit is just a standard manual count by the floor staff once a week. they use handheld scanners to log everything. \n\nthe process seems fine, but we keep seeing these single digit losses. do u think it could be an issue with the unit of measure in the system or maybe just lag in the database updates?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
